abstract: >-
  The DSecO project is a data model for representing and reasoning
  on Domain Name System (DNS) data.

  The ontology is developed using web technologies
  (e.g. RDF, OWL, SKOS) and is intended as a structure
  for realizing a DNS Knowledge Graph (KG)
  for administration and security assessment applications.
